    {
      "id": "cb120000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "kind": "post",
      "editorial_profile_id": "bibi-story:luna",
      "title": "",
      "body": "Costume reference: clasped hands, a red dress and two blue horns make the silhouette readable before anyone moves. I would study this pose for a one-frame animation of someone gathering courage. Which detail would you move first?",
      "created_at": "2026-10-26T00:00:00Z",
      "revision_id": "e91d7a23-6dfb-5b2d-92f0-4344a41d870a",
      "editorial": true,
      "circle_id": "animation",
      "source_kind": "fictional_story",
      "media_id": "fdf189a6-f283-5809-88a1-517d97844f56",
      "credit": "Photo: Quyet Nguyen \u00b7 Pexels",
      "source_url": "https://www.pexels.com/photo/vibrant-anime-cosplay-costume-portrait-39797621/",
      "description": "A cosplayer in a red dress with blue horn accessories and clasped hands."
    },
    {
      "id": "cb130000-0000-4000-8000-000000000010",
      "kind": "reply",
      "editorial_profile_id": "bibi-story:kai",
      "title": "",
      "body": "The hands. A small opening of the fingers could show the decision.",
      "created_at": "2026-10-26T00:05:00Z",
      "revision_id": "2ce3db3f-27ea-527b-b217-360b3c7447d8",
      "editorial": true,
      "parent_id": "cb120000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "source_kind": "fictional_story_reply"
    },
    {
      "id": "cb130000-0000-4000-8000-000000000011",
      "kind": "reply",
      "editorial_profile_id": "bibi-story:mira",
      "title": "",
      "body": "I would move one horn ribbon so the stillness feels deliberate.",
      "created_at": "2026-10-26T00:10:00Z",
      "revision_id": "2f668d1d-8bf1-5264-8ce2-7d5b8b4a0a50",
      "editorial": true,
      "parent_id": "cb120000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "source_kind": "fictional_story_reply"
    },
    {
      "id": "cb120000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "kind": "post",
      "editorial_profile_id": "bibi-story:kai",
      "title": "",
      "body": "A convention reference: pink hair, a black jacket and a red bow, turned toward another person. The conversation is already happening in the body language. For a short animated exchange, would you start on the listener or the speaker?",
      "created_at": "2026-10-25T23:00:00Z",
      "revision_id": "3f0b46bc-18f6-5240-9651-1b34f39a7a88",
      "editorial": true,
      "circle_id": "animation",
      "source_kind": "fictional_story",
      "media_id": "574550c5-ed1f-5b38-887f-b3afa8c1f363",
      "credit": "Photo: Mario Spencer \u00b7 Pexels",
      "source_url": "https://www.pexels.com/photo/cosplay-enthusiast-at-outdoor-anime-convention-29901442/",
      "description": "A cosplayer with a pink wig and a black suit turned toward another attendee."
    },
    {
      "id": "cb130000-0000-4000-8000-000000000020",
      "kind": "reply",
      "editorial_profile_id": "bibi-story:mira",
      "title": "",
      "body": "The listener first. The turn of the head already tells me who is speaking.",
      "created_at": "2026-10-25T23:05:00Z",
      "revision_id": "0db414fb-834b-5fe3-a1fd-1dddc9fd23d8",
      "editorial": true,
      "parent_id": "cb120000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "source_kind": "fictional_story_reply"
    },
    {
      "id": "cb130000-0000-4000-8000-000000000021",
      "kind": "reply",
      "editorial_profile_id": "bibi-story:rowan",
      "title": "",
      "body": "I would start on the red bow, then reveal the other person.",
      "created_at": "2026-10-25T23:10:00Z",
      "revision_id": "c1fd65b8-ca13-5905-9140-13b5fcef51ad",
      "editorial": true,
      "parent_id": "cb120000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "source_kind": "fictional_story_reply"
    },
    {
      "id": "cb120000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "kind": "post",
      "editorial_profile_id": "bibi-story:theo",
      "title": "",
      "body": "Hall study: one mint-haired costume stands still while the convention keeps moving behind them. That contrast could be a quiet establishing shot. Would you hold the pose or let the background carry the motion?",
      "created_at": "2026-10-25T22:00:00Z",
      "revision_id": "888925a4-d79b-5eaa-a0af-acc02eeb1585",
      "editorial": true,
      "circle_id": "animation",
      "source_kind": "fictional_story",
      "media_id": "e4c75821-6043-5a3c-b49f-c44603462c5c",
      "credit": "Photo: TBD Tuyen \u00b7 Pexels",
      "source_url": "https://www.pexels.com/photo/cosplay-character-at-convention-center-event-37206376/",
      "description": "A cosplayer with mint hair standing in a busy convention hall."
    },
    {
      "id": "cb130000-0000-4000-8000-000000000030",
      "kind": "reply",
      "editorial_profile_id": "bibi-story:luna",
      "title": "",
      "body": "Hold the pose. The busy hall does the moving for you.",
      "created_at": "2026-10-25T22:05:00Z",
      "revision_id": "18a3eb7a-79f7-5b66-adab-66312d6c0c18",
      "editorial": true,
      "parent_id": "cb120000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "source_kind": "fictional_story_reply"
    },
    {
      "id": "cb130000-0000-4000-8000-000000000031",
      "kind": "reply",
      "editorial_profile_id": "bibi-story:kai",
      "title": "",
      "body": "A slow blink would be enough. The coat already feels heavy and calm.",
      "created_at": "2026-10-25T22:10:00Z",
      "revision_id": "4500ba90-7fc9-5358-974c-461ada7bfe87",
      "editorial": true,
      "parent_id": "cb120000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "source_kind": "fictional_story_reply"
    },
    {
      "id": "cb120000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "kind": "post",
      "editorial_profile_id": "bibi-story:rowan",
      "title": "",
      "body": "Character notebook from a licensed cosplay portrait: black roots into red lengths, both hands gathering the hair. The face stays calm while the color does the talking. Which feature would you exaggerate in an original design?",
      "created_at": "2026-10-25T21:00:00Z",
      "revision_id": "c7cf6328-374f-5c95-be47-24549e3fb86a",
      "editorial": true,
      "circle_id": "characters",
      "source_kind": "fictional_story",
