      "credit": "Photo: TBD Tuyen \u00b7 Pexels",
      "source_url": "https://www.pexels.com/photo/colorful-cosplay-portrait-at-convention-33156707/",
      "description": "A close portrait of a cosplayer with black and red hair holding the ends of the wig."
    },
    {
      "id": "cb130000-0000-4000-8000-000000000040",
      "kind": "reply",
      "editorial_profile_id": "bibi-story:nova",
      "title": "",
      "body": "The color break in the hair. It reads from across a room.",
      "created_at": "2026-10-25T21:05:00Z",
      "revision_id": "001e190b-0dcf-5332-93a9-b31931922828",
      "editorial": true,
      "parent_id": "cb120000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "source_kind": "fictional_story_reply"
    },
    {
      "id": "cb130000-0000-4000-8000-000000000041",
      "kind": "reply",
      "editorial_profile_id": "bibi-story:theo",
      "title": "",
      "body": "I would keep the calm face and make the hands more deliberate.",
      "created_at": "2026-10-25T21:10:00Z",
      "revision_id": "c59b68f9-3f66-5972-8c9e-e6e8ae7e7085",
      "editorial": true,
      "parent_id": "cb120000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "source_kind": "fictional_story_reply"
    },
    {
      "id": "cb120000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "kind": "post",
      "editorial_profile_id": "bibi-story:mira",
      "title": "",
      "body": "Character reference: a green and yellow headband, two white pom-poms and a cream vest over green. The costume reads clearly from the shoulders up. Which piece would you keep if you had to simplify it?",
      "created_at": "2026-10-25T20:00:00Z",
      "revision_id": "68b8806c-a707-59a2-a030-0fda1b93e09f",
      "editorial": true,
      "circle_id": "characters",
      "source_kind": "fictional_story",
