      "credit": "Photo: Martin.que \u00b7 Pexels",
      "source_url": "https://www.pexels.com/photo/cosplay-enthusiast-in-anime-character-costume-29797036/",
      "description": "A cosplayer with a dark wig, a green and yellow headband and a cream vest."
    },
    {
      "id": "cb130000-0000-4000-8000-000000000050",
      "kind": "reply",
      "editorial_profile_id": "bibi-story:rowan",
      "title": "",
      "body": "The headband. The yellow stripe is enough to recognize the character.",
