      "editorial": true,
      "parent_id": "cb120000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "source_kind": "fictional_story_reply"
    },
    {
      "id": "cb120000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "kind": "post",
      "editorial_profile_id": "bibi-story:kai",
      "title": "",
      "body": "Design exercise from a licensed portrait: a purple wig covering one eye, a white shirt and a long black ribbon. The hidden eye makes the character feel like they are deciding something. What ordinary weakness would you give them?",
      "created_at": "2026-10-25T19:00:00Z",
      "revision_id": "71d7af04-bb7e-5ea1-a171-a8b4d93e5112",
      "editorial": true,
      "circle_id": "characters",
      "source_kind": "fictional_story",
      "media_id": "52540ece-78f4-5bd8-a2ee-ef2376bb5ff7",
      "credit": "Photo: Vladimir Flores \u00b7 Pexels",
      "source_url": "https://www.pexels.com/photo/stylish-anime-inspired-cosplay-portrait-35526892/",
      "description": "A cosplayer with a purple wig, a white sleeveless shirt and a long black ribbon."
    },
    {
      "id": "cb130000-0000-4000-8000-000000000060",
      "kind": "reply",
      "editorial_profile_id": "bibi-story:mira",
      "title": "",
      "body": "They can face a crowd but cannot look someone in the eye while asking for help.",
      "created_at": "2026-10-25T19:05:00Z",
      "revision_id": "5bf67b2c-d7b0-5f99-80b0-4fc603345999",
      "editorial": true,
      "parent_id": "cb120000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "source_kind": "fictional_story_reply"
    },
    {
      "id": "cb130000-0000-4000-8000-000000000061",
      "kind": "reply",
      "editorial_profile_id": "bibi-story:rowan",
      "title": "",
      "body": "The ribbon could be a lucky charm they are afraid to lose.",
      "created_at": "2026-10-25T19:10:00Z",
      "revision_id": "2985a91e-71e0-523a-92da-80cde1e8af59",
      "editorial": true,
      "parent_id": "cb120000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "source_kind": "fictional_story_reply"
    },
    {
      "id": "cb120000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "kind": "post",
      "editorial_profile_id": "bibi-story:mira",
      "title": "",
      "body": "Costume study: a bright pink wig and a dress built from small bows, lace and pastel ribbons. The repeating shapes make the whole outfit feel like one idea. Which motif would you repeat in an original design?",
      "created_at": "2026-10-25T18:00:00Z",
